{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a cozy cabin that feels like home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to peaceful Retreats in changing seasons and weather. Build, decorate, and furnish at your own pace, and collect Keepsakes with softly narrated backstories. No grind. No pressure. Just nature, animals, and time to breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/560145f8f0a037ed33004c02038e4511.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/560145f8f0a037ed33004c02038e4511.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/560145f8f0a037ed33004c02038e4511.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How it feels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet places to exhale: seaside coves, inland meadows, and mountain hideaways across fall, winter, and summer\u2014each with a different mood in the light and weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/9ab419f08a3fb924e4c5fada471d0aaf.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/9ab419f08a3fb924e4c5fada471d0aaf.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/9ab419f08a3fb924e4c5fada471d0aaf.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As lamps glow and corners gather comfort, you feel the room warm around you, the retreat growing cozier with every thoughtful touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you love matters: the interests you choose color what appears and which quiet stories surface, so discoveries feel aligned with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/d7c7ea3922803250d577cd762280892b.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/d7c7ea3922803250d577cd762280892b.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/d7c7ea3922803250d577cd762280892b.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Keepsakes carry softly narrated memories; together they settle into your Keepsakes collection\u2014an album\u2011like place you can revisit whenever you need a reminder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/3eef5de23fd2b457c04175f86f41f9e6.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/3eef5de23fd2b457c04175f86f41f9e6.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/3eef5de23fd2b457c04175f86f41f9e6.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calming acoustic score and natural soundscapes lift the mood and immerse you in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/5bf3458692a142f5894e7c921d22684c.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/5bf3458692a142f5894e7c921d22684c.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/5bf3458692a142f5894e7c921d22684c.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you\u2019ll do</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a retreat and settle in as the time of day and weather drift softly around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select up to three interests (from ten). They gently shape decorating and furnishing options and nudge later discoveries, including which Keepsakes you\u2019ll uncover, without locking you in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/807abed086eabbf0728241b10c448131.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/807abed086eabbf0728241b10c448131.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/807abed086eabbf0728241b10c448131.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate at your own pace. Place, rotate, and refine with lamps, chairs, plants, and more, shaping the mood indoors and out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/60281b53ea85c3814087cee6558c7e01.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/60281b53ea85c3814087cee6558c7e01.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/60281b53ea85c3814087cee6558c7e01.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your Cozy Heart. As the space truly warms, your Cozy Heart reaches full; when it does, travel bags arrive with new Keepsakes to unpack and arrange. It\u2019s a reflection of coziness, not a pressure meter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/ff77a8681916673aeb3467fa311c985b.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/ff77a8681916673aeb3467fa311c985b.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/ff77a8681916673aeb3467fa311c985b.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit your Keepsakes collection to browse what you\u2019ve found and hear gentle backstories again, whenever you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return anytime to tidy, tweak, and enjoy the quiet of your retreats, or start a new one.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/7a6791d3080b8c3869dfdeb2436aab24.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/7a6791d3080b8c3869dfdeb2436aab24.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/7a6791d3080b8c3869dfdeb2436aab24.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to an acoustic soundtrack with over 20 tracks composed by Chris Haugen, crafted to slow the world around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize every moment with the Cozy Tools: capture breathtaking screenshots in Photo Mode, control the weather, change the time of day, and switch between visual styles for a unique vibe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/9ea731d4a2bb0954b7974395b7edd1e8.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/9ea731d4a2bb0954b7974395b7edd1e8.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/9ea731d4a2bb0954b7974395b7edd1e8.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A love letter to yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Log Away is a game about coming back to yourself: simple moments, small comforts, the hush of rain on the window and a lamp glowing at dusk\u2026 No meters to chase. No timers. Just a retreat that waits for you, ready whenever you need to breathe.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pet Friendly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3468400/d5f36fff88d593487ef4d71c4c02cffcfaacd06f.jpg"},{"name":"Divine Intervention","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3468400/f68ad33c7f9bbb76fc4b5e3e6caa6e2ff52a769b.jpg"},{"name":"Logged and Ready","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3468400/d9ee06a048d215e5a768e83ad49115ab596a81ee.jpg"},{"name":"Natural Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3468400/492bb4fb2667f0198f179692c6265bd504d287a0.jpg"},{"name":"Seasoned Traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3468400/b4c6a7a5f04b15637eaa43b7da257f771848a3cb.jpg"},{"name":"Cozy Connoisseur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3468400/b09e9ddb03b31bdeb5c74a5c31b99a81b93509bf.jpg"},{"name":"Synergy Savvy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3468400/05f90bb66e909cd0d22fe3357cf3595e447fcb36.jpg"},{"name":"Off the Mark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3468400/b5da46deb41b6a00a47bd2afd44664b6cc915148.jpg"},{"name":"Wondering Wanderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3468400/b74b506af76c21d3598968a6e8cabefd91a08f86.jpg"},{"name":"Quite Interested","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3468400/c002be47acf765c46be9fb1482ca64efd7712ee4.jpg"}],"total":50},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3468400?t=1774003339","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/58ae68d0ccca026f05fc16d6ab11b11f0c935486/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774003339","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/f6800b22eb7c556f4a16eef933d3222403a2425f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774003339","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/f6800b22eb7c556f4a16eef933d3222403a2425f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774003339","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a cozy cabin that feels like home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to peaceful Retreats in changing seasons and weather. Build, decorate, and furnish at your own pace, and collect Keepsakes with softly narrated backstories. No grind. No pressure. Just nature, animals, and time to breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/560145f8f0a037ed33004c02038e4511.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/560145f8f0a037ed33004c02038e4511.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/560145f8f0a037ed33004c02038e4511.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How it feels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quiet places to exhale: seaside coves, inland meadows, and mountain hideaways across fall, winter, and summer\u2014each with a different mood in the light and weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/9ab419f08a3fb924e4c5fada471d0aaf.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/9ab419f08a3fb924e4c5fada471d0aaf.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/9ab419f08a3fb924e4c5fada471d0aaf.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As lamps glow and corners gather comfort, you feel the room warm around you, the retreat growing cozier with every thoughtful touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you love matters: the interests you choose color what appears and which quiet stories surface, so discoveries feel aligned with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/d7c7ea3922803250d577cd762280892b.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/d7c7ea3922803250d577cd762280892b.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/d7c7ea3922803250d577cd762280892b.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Keepsakes carry softly narrated memories; together they settle into your Keepsakes collection\u2014an album\u2011like place you can revisit whenever you need a reminder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/3eef5de23fd2b457c04175f86f41f9e6.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati