ce src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/807abed086eabbf0728241b10c448131.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate at your own pace. Place, rotate, and refine with lamps, chairs, plants, and more, shaping the mood indoors and out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/60281b53ea85c3814087cee6558c7e01.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/60281b53ea85c3814087cee6558c7e01.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/60281b53ea85c3814087cee6558c7e01.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your Cozy Heart. As the space truly warms, your Cozy Heart reaches full; when it does, travel bags arrive with new Keepsakes to unpack and arrange. It\u2019s a reflection of coziness, not a pressure meter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/ff77a8681916673aeb3467fa311c985b.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/ff77a8681916673aeb3467fa311c985b.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/ff77a8681916673aeb3467fa311c985b.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit your Keepsakes collection to browse what you\u2019ve found and hear gentle backstories again, whenever you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return anytime to tidy, tweak, and enjoy the quiet of your retreats, or start a new one.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/7a6791d3080b8c3869dfdeb2436aab24.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/7a6791d3080b8c3869dfdeb2436aab24.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/7a6791d3080b8c3869dfdeb2436aab24.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to an acoustic soundtrack with over 20 tracks composed by Chris Haugen, crafted to slow the world around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize every moment with the Cozy Tools: capture breathtaking screenshots in Photo Mode, control the weather, change the time of day, and switch between visual styles for a unique vibe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/9ea731d4a2bb0954b7974395b7edd1e8.poster.avif?t=1774003339\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/9ea731d4a2bb0954b7974395b7edd1e8.webm?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/extras/9ea731d4a2bb0954b7974395b7edd1e8.mp4?t=1774003339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A love letter to yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Log Away is a game about coming back to yourself: simple moments, small comforts, the hush of rain on the window and a lamp glowing at dusk\u2026 No meters to chase. No timers. Just a retreat that waits for you, ready whenever you need to breathe.</p>","developers":["The-Mark Entertainment"],"dlc":[4418680,4171300],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468400/944d5e5a6a199dff7e6073826b5c0cc5b2ea0e70/header.jpg?t=1774003339","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 The-Mark Entertainment d.o.o. Log Away is a trademark or a registered trademark of The-Mark Entertainment. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3468400/986480593/fa722393131ef352f0150f3d792aed9a9f747aff/1764859540/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764860742","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3468400/986480593/fa722393131ef352f0150f3d792aed9a9f747aff/1764859540/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764860742","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3468400/986480593/fa722393131ef352f0150f3d792aed9a9f747aff/1764859540/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764860742","id":257243615,"name":"Log Away - Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257243615/655683613f8cc79123387cae7f27bd275836d345/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764860742"}],"name":"Log Away","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","na